1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Ah... ahh... AHHH-CHOO!

2
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:03,322
WHO... woke... ME?

3
00:00:03,422 --> 00:00:06,689
Little doughs! Stay inside me... it's comfy!

4
00:00:06,790 --> 00:00:08,469
Run! Everyone run!

5
00:00:08,569 --> 00:00:11,379
Too late. Wobblor slurps Bup right up.

6
00:00:11,479 --> 00:00:15,846
Guys? It's dark in here. And sticky. And it smells like grapes.

7
00:00:15,946 --> 00:00:17,469
Let. Him. GO!

8
00:00:17,570 --> 00:00:20,717
Hee hee! Angry cookies are the squishiest!
